## 07_trees - 

This directory contains the pipeline for generating phylogenetic trees for Class I and Class II Fumarase sequences using both Amino Acid (AA) and Structural (3Di) data.

## Data

- 'results/alignments/class1_aligned.fasta'
- 'results/alignments/class2_aligned.fasta'

- 'data/processed/class1_3di_aligned.fasta'
- 'data/processed/class2_3di_aligned.fasta'


